#N canvas 600 600 700 300 taps 0;
#X obj 20 20 inlet~;
#X obj 200 20 inlet;
#X obj 320 20 inlet;
#X obj 440 20 inlet;
#X obj 20 100 *~ 0;
#X obj 20 140 throw~ \$2-verb;
#X obj 200 100 *~ 0;
#X obj 200 140 throw~ \$2-d\$1;
#X obj 440 100 switch~;
#X text 20 200 The voice at its send \, to e_verb \, and at its delay's level \, to its e_delay: on while either is above 0 \, so while both are 0 neither is thrown. Each throw~'s catch~ is on whenever it is thrown anything but zeros (e_verb \, e_delay)., f 80;
#X obj 20 60 *~;
#X obj 200 200 r \$2-gate;
#X obj 200 240 line~;
#X obj 320 200 loadbang;
#X msg 320 240 1;
#X text 20 300 The gate: 0 while a repeat is held \, so the replayed hits and any pad hit send nothing to the delays or the reverb (e_tape). It moves in one block \, and a hit's sound only rises 2 ms in \, so that hit sends nothing at all \, and a voice switched off hears it at its next hit. line~ starts at 0 \, so 1 at load \, which needs no DSP., f 80;
#X connect 0 0 10 0;
#X connect 11 0 12 0;
