#X connect 4 0 5 0;
#X connect 6 0 7 0;
#X restore 400 1300 pd taps;
#X text 640 1180 The distortion adds to the read what it changes: its outlet~ sums with the read into the voice's and into taps \, so at mix 0 \, e_drive off \, the sample passes as it always did. The send and the delay's level are squared \, so a knob's lower half is quiet \, and taken at once \, since only the reverb and the delay hear them., f 40;
