#X obj 1000 760 t f f f;
#X text 1000 680 A pitch that arrives works the length and the rate out again through t f f f \, not the t above it \, which also finds the sample's peak: a track's random pitch can arrive before every hit \, and that scan would take longer than a step., f 40;
